WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.804
A hospital marker tells us where a building is.

00:00:03.804 --> 00:00:09.299
It does not establish suitable care or reveal fragile access across a river.

00:00:09.299 --> 00:00:14.371
VenomLink connects geographic evidence, real driving estimates, and infrastructure scenarios in Lahore.

00:00:14.371 --> 00:00:19.021
This is a working hackathon prototype, shown through actual application screenshots.

00:00:19.821 --> 00:00:25.017
Each independent facility record has coordinates, source links, quality, and a retrieval timestamp.

00:00:25.017 --> 00:00:31.811
Flip a card to inspect the actual record, served through the deployed private S three data path.

00:00:31.811 --> 00:00:34.609
Treatment capability and antivenom stock remain unknown.

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:37.807
A retrieval date does not mean clinical verification.

00:00:38.607 --> 00:00:43.629
The separate planning model uses explicit assumptions about distance, speed and access overhead.

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:48.265
At twenty minutes, four of eight sample communities meet the baseline threshold.

00:00:48.265 --> 00:00:52.515
Making Shahdara Town T H Q eligible raises that to six.

00:00:52.515 --> 00:00:57.538
This is a hypothetical planning change, not a real treatment or stock claim.

00:00:58.338 --> 00:01:04.782
At thirty minutes, a hypothetical crossing delay reduces sampled access from five communities to four.

00:01:04.782 --> 00:01:07.789
Only crossing dependent journeys receive that delay.

00:01:07.789 --> 00:01:11.655
Closure removes those model connections without inventing a detour.

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:14.662
These percentages count sample communities, not population.

00:01:14.662 --> 00:01:18.528
The scenarios do not change Google's reported road conditions.

00:01:19.328 --> 00:01:24.306
Amazon Location Search Nearby and Search Text run through A W S Lambda.

00:01:24.306 --> 00:01:27.752
Hospital category searches returned no matches in our tests.

00:01:27.752 --> 00:01:33.113
An area search returned the actual Shahdara locality, clearly labeled as a geographic reference.

00:01:33.113 --> 00:01:39.239
Zero matches do not establish that hospitals are absent, and a locality is not medical care.

00:01:40.039 --> 00:01:44.646
Python validation prepares independent public facts for private S three delivery.

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:47.997
Provider discovery stays in an attributed, temporary list.

00:01:47.997 --> 00:01:50.510
Google geometry stays on Google Maps.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:54.280
The backend route credential is stored in Secrets Manager.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:02:00.144
Optional Iceberg and Athena scripts are included, but those analytics extensions are not deployed.

00:02:00.944 --> 00:02:06.301
The no billing Google Maps Demo Key renders the map and supports Compute Routes.

00:02:06.301 --> 00:02:10.510
The protected backend returns actual driving estimates and traffic speed intervals.

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:17.015
An on demand comparison uses up to five supported route calls, avoiding the billing only matrix method.

00:02:17.015 --> 00:02:19.311
Provider limits can pause this prototype.

00:02:19.311 --> 00:02:21.989
Driving estimates are not ambulance response times.

00:02:22.789 --> 00:02:27.887
The optional photo helper contains labeled illustrations and a local image preview.

00:02:27.887 --> 00:02:32.135
No trained classifier is connected, and no identification is invented.

00:02:32.135 --> 00:02:36.808
VenomLink makes geographic access, its assumptions, and each point's evidence inspectable.

00:02:36.808 --> 00:02:42.755
Real healthcare partnerships and verified clinical data remain essential before any operational care use.
